<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.holder.resumes ~ the hooks run again

`lares sense resume` un-pauses the hook legs a quiesce paused; holders re-spawn lazily. A leading sensorium name (`lares sense <sensorium> <verb>`) addresses any named sensorium; bare, the verb reads `memory`.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ resume

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`resume` params=`~ un-pause the hooks`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ sensorium-root

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`sensorium-root` params=`takes/host-path ~ the sensorium's root; the leading sensorium name threads it, absent the memory sensorium`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ writes this host's hook pause; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ resumed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`resumed` params=`exit/0 ~ the hooks run`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

